   "text_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<h4>200G TCP in hardware for multi-stream, line rate transport without a CPU or external DDR.</h4>\n<p>TOE200G-IP implements the full TCP stack in logic and connects directly to 200 GbE MAC and PHY on supported FPGA platforms. The core is built for sustained multi-session throughput with predictable latency and a simple streaming interface to user logic.</p>",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
  "heading_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "cq:styleIds": [
    "1717498053499"
   ],
   "heading_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:title": "Highlights",
    "type": "h2",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
   }
  },
  "text_2_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "cq:styleIds": [
    "1717498053499"
   ],
   "text_2": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<ul>\n<li>Hardware TCP server and client with multi-session scheduling and scalable queues</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>AXI4-Stream payload interfaces and register control for configuration and status</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Works with 200 GbE MAC and PCS blocks including RS-FEC where required</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Reference projects for half duplex and full duplex tests, ping reply, parameter setting, and integrated throughput apps</li>\n</ul>",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
  "heading_2_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "cq:styleIds": [
    "1717498053499"
   ],
   "heading_2": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:title": "Why Macnica?",
    "type": "h2",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
   }
  },
  "text_3_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "cq:styleIds": [
    "1717498053499"
   ],
   "text_3": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<ul>\n<li>Queue sizing and connection planning for 200G targets, including jumbo MTU recommendations</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Transceiver and RS-FEC configuration on Agilex F-Tile, plus validated MAC selections for 200G links</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Lab validation plans for soak tests and packet integrity at line rate</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Integration with NVMe or NVMe over TCP storage paths for capture and replay</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Supply and evaluation hardware coordination so you can move from demo to pilot without stalls</li>\n</ul>",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
